      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In addition, most people play games with their relatives and make song-pyeun, which is a Korean traditional rice cake.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I like our country's traditional holidays.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "On these days I learn how important family is!",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "During Chu-seok, People visit their ancestrial tombs and make an offering of food to their ancestors.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Chu-seok is the biggest national holiday of the year, and it is often referred to as the Korean Thanksgiving.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "K-IG 교육 FOR STUDENT",
